                                                "sense_id": "ca22bb44-8579-3f60-b0ec-66e87ec7f34f",
                                                "text": "I didn't fully appreciate the amazingness of French viennoiserie (croissants, etc.) until I found myself in Switzerland ordering a pain au chocolat."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "77af04eb-b75c-4c6b-b35b-277cb38c75fa",
                                                "sense_id": "ca22bb44-8579-3f60-b0ec-66e87ec7f34f",
                                                "text": "The term viennoiserie appeared at the beginning of the twentieth century, initially referring to Viennese breads and croissants introduced by the Austrian August Zang."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
